WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
First, read your mission and check what you need to build.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.200
Next, build one step at a time and tick each step when it works.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.300
Then, run your program, look at the output and fix any problems.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.600
Finally, send your work and tell your teacher what you learned.
